{"message":"Yes. The Purple Account includes eligible direct deposits up to 2 days early, including paychecks, although the exact posting time depends on when your employer submits the payroll file.

For your stated priorities, it remains the strongest match: it charges no Rho-Bank fee for foreign ATM withdrawals, has a 0% foreign transaction fee, and provides up to $30 per month in rebates for ATM operator fees. It also supports early direct deposit up to 2 days ahead of payday.

One important cost to consider is the $15 monthly maintenance fee, waived with a minimum daily balance of $3,750. ATM operator fees can also exceed the $30 monthly rebate cap, and Purple applies a 0.5% currency-conversion markup when converting currencies."}

